 ],
 "description": "Copy of \"anchor: resource-permission\" that sends resource_type when it creates a role or permission. It replaces the original once ADR-0022 PR 1 is deployed. Resource permission CRUD, duplicate refusal, one not-found code (RESOURCE_PERMISSION_NOT_FOUND) on GET/PUT/DELETE, delete of a permission a role holds cascades (204, the role loses it and gets product.role.updated), and every event checked in one final webhook wait.",
 "updated_at": "2026-10-26T04:02:02.861781Z",
